    {
      "key": "ui.event.info_count_body",
      "text": "Only the {0} glades below count, and only the first time you finish one inside the window — a glade you cleared before the event opened is one you have already been paid for. There are {1} blooms along the vine, worth {2} credits between them."
    },
    {
      "key": "ui.event.info_collect_title",
      "text": "nothing is taken for you"
    },
    {
      "key": "ui.event.info_collect_body",
      "text": "A bloom opens the moment you reach it, and then it waits. Come back and tap it and the credits are yours. Tapping a bloom higher up the vine takes every open one below it at the same time, so nothing can be left behind."
    },
    {
      "key": "ui.event.info_window_title",
      "text": "when the window shuts"
    },
    {
      "key": "ui.event.info_window_body",
      "text": "Glades stop counting when the event closes. Blooms do not — anything you grew stays on the vine until you take it, however long that is."
    },
